pleasant|Breeze gives enjoyment/comfort rather than being pleased itself. Cooling after lunch and Vietnamese agree; the adjective is not restricted to weather or a person's manner.
site|Physical location and website are distinct ordinal-supported boundaries. Planned future garden and present volunteer listings translate correctly; online visit is explicitly distinguished from travel.
worldwide|Adjective reach and adverb distribution have different POS and examples, with both source ordinals. Vietnamese global reach is natural without claiming literal universal coverage.
crowd|Gathered people noun matches welcome scene and musician participants. Countable collective usage checked; source noun evidence does not authorize a separate crowd verb or canonical identity.
further|Additional adjective and greater-distance adverb separated. Details versus walking contexts align; contradictory PREPOSITION evidence is not silently accepted and remains an undrafted source classification concern.
